{
  "id": "PRO.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 4",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Listen to what your father teaches you, my children. Pay attention, and you will have understanding. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What I am teaching you is good, so remember it all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I was only a little boy, my parents' only son, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my father would teach me. He would say, “Remember what I say and never forget it. Do as I tell you, and you will live. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Get wisdom and insight! Do not forget or ignore what I say. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not abandon wisdom, and she will protect you; love her, and she will keep you safe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Getting wisdom is the most important thing you can do. Whatever else you get, get insight. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Love wisdom, and she will make you great. Embrace her,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4.8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Embrace her",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Prize her highly.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and she will bring you honour. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She will be your crowning glory.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Listen to me, my child. Take seriously what I am telling you, and you will live a long life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have taught you wisdom and the right way to live. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nothing will stand in your way if you walk wisely, and you will not stumble when you run. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Always remember what you have learnt. Your education is your life — guard it well. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not go where evil people go. Do not follow the example of the wicked. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't do it! Keep away from evil! Refuse it and go on your way. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wicked people cannot sleep unless they have done something wrong. They lie awake unless they have hurt someone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wickedness and violence are like food and drink to them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The road the righteous travel is like the sunrise, getting brighter and brighter until daylight has come. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The road of the wicked, however, is dark as night. They fall, but cannot see what they have stumbled over.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pay attention to what I say, my child. Listen to my words. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Never let them get away from you. Remember them and keep them in your heart. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They will give life and health to anyone who understands them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be careful how you think; your life is shaped by your thoughts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Never say anything that isn't true. Have nothing to do with lies and misleading words. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Look straight ahead with honest confidence; don't hang your head in shame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 12.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Plan carefully what you do, and whatever you do will turn out right. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avoid evil and walk straight ahead. Don't go one step off the right way.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PRO.5",
    "number": "5",
    "bookId": "PRO"
  },
